MOSS RGBA

This project adapts the following upstream work:

MOSS-Image — OpenMOSS Team
https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image
Base model: https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT
Upstream model and code license: Apache License 2.0.

FLUX.2 Autoencoder — Black Forest Labs
https://github.com/black-forest-labs/flux2#flux2-autoencoder
The FLUX.2 autoencoder is separately released under Apache License 2.0.
The RGBA VAE changes its image input/output to four channels and merges the learned adapter.

This project's code and adapted weights are distributed under GPLv3.
Upstream attribution and license terms are retained.
